### Template Comparison

**Indicatif** (String-based):
```rust
let style = ProgressStyle::default_bar()
    .template("[{elapsed_precise}] {bar:40.cyan/blue} {pos:>7}/{len:7}")
    .unwrap();
```

**Progress-RS** (Type-safe):
```rust
let template = Template::builder()
    .elapsed()
    .spacer()
    .bar(40, Color::Cyan, Color::Blue)
    .spacer()
    .current()
    .literal("/")
    .total()
    .build();
```

